@startuml CD Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2196F3
skinparam ActivityFontColor #1565C0
skinparam ArrowColor #1976D2
skinparam ActivityBarColor #1976D2

title Continuous Deployment Workflows\nAll triggered via repository_dispatch from shared-release.yml

|#E8F4FD|cd-aws.yml|
start
:repository_dispatch\n(deploy-aws);
note right
  From shared-release.yml:
  module_name, module_version,
  released_artifact_name, ci_run_id
  Modules: website, api, admin
end note

:Setup & AWS Auth (OIDC);
:Restore Docker Image from CI;
:**Push to ECR**;
note right
  Tags: version + latest
end note
:ECS Auto-Deploy;
note right
  EventBridge triggers
  on 'latest' tag
end note
stop

|#FFF8E1|cd-bulletin.yml|
start
:repository_dispatch\n(deploy-bulletin);
note right
  From shared-release.yml
  (release_bulletin in ci.yml)
end note
:Setup & AWS Auth (OIDC);
:Download Lambda ZIP artifact;
:**aws lambda update-function-code**;
note right
  bible-on-site-bulletin
  aarch64-unknown-linux-musl
end note
stop

|#E8F5E9|cd-app.yml|
start
:repository_dispatch\n(deploy-app);
note right
  From release_app job in ci.yml:
  module_version, ci_run_id,
  artifacts: msix / aab / ipa /
  ios_assetpacks / ios_payloads.
  Each platform job runs only when
  its artifact name is present —
  partial payloads still deploy.
end note

fork
  :Restore MSIX;
  :**Deploy to MS Store**;
  note right
    Flight: Internal
    Partner Center API
  end note
fork again
  :Restore AAB;
  :**Deploy to Google Play**;
  note right
    Track: Internal
    Play Console API
  end note
fork again
  :**Deploy to App Store**\n(deploy_app_store, macos-15);
  note right
    Restore exact .ipa + .aar asset
    packs from the app-v* release;
    check TestFlight for the build,
    fastlane pilot upload if missing,
    verify Apple processed it,
    upload asset packs to
    App Store Connect.
  end note
  :**Distribute to TestFlight**\n(testflight-distribution.yml);
  note right
    Assign verified build to tester
    groups; shared app-CD lock held
    across the handoff. Manual
    recovery re-runs either workflow
    by artifact name + ci_run_id.
  end note
end fork
stop

|#FFF3E0|cd-data.yml|
start
:repository_dispatch\n(deploy-data);
note right
  From release_data job in ci.yml.
  SQL archive bound by immutable
  artifact id + SHA-256 digest —
  a skipped perushim job binds the
  current master's baseline.
end note

:Setup & AWS Auth (OIDC);
:Download & verify pinned SQL archive;
:**Run Data Migration** (prod RDS);
stop

@enduml
